+ * Docs CHROME beyond the prose + the shared topbar: the skip link and the docs
+ * sidebar nav-toggle (forwarded into <flatbars-topbar>'s `start` slot), plus the
+ * inline-code plate reset for runtime-highlighted tags. The wordmark, Theme,
